%%report prospect-lifecycle title: Prospect lifecycle entity: Prospect chart: bar x: state y: records help: A potential client being qualified by an assigned adviser. Where prospects sit in their state machine, in the order the diagram draws it; a state nothing has reached shows as zero. sql: SELECT d.state, COALESCE(c.records, 0) AS records FROM (SELECT 'new' AS state, 0 AS position UNION ALL SELECT 'contacted', 1 UNION ALL SELECT 'qualified', 2 UNION ALL SELECT 'meeting', 3 UNION ALL SELECT 'proposal', 4 UNION ALL SELECT 'converted', 5 UNION ALL SELECT 'lost', 6) d LEFT JOIN (SELECT status AS state, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_prospect WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1) c ON c.state = d.state ORDER BY d.position
%%report prospect-estimated-aum-by-status title: Total estimated aum by status entity: Prospect chart: bar x: status y: total_estimated_aum help: A potential client being qualified by an assigned adviser. Prospects added up on estimated aum, split by status, to show where the quantity sits. sql: SELECT COALESCE(status::text, '(unset)') AS status, ROUND(SUM(estimated_aum)::numeric, 2) AS total_estimated_aum FROM bus_prospect WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST
