%%report goal-lifecycle title: Goal lifecycle entity: Goal chart: bar x: state y: records help: Financial objective tracked through planning, funding and achievement. Where goals sit in their state machine, in the order the diagram draws it; a state nothing has reached shows as zero. sql: SELECT d.state, COALESCE(c.records, 0) AS records FROM (SELECT 'identified' AS state, 0 AS position UNION ALL SELECT 'planned', 1 UNION ALL SELECT 'funded', 2 UNION ALL SELECT 'achieved', 3 UNION ALL SELECT 'cancelled', 4) d LEFT JOIN (SELECT status AS state, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_goal WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1) c ON c.state = d.state ORDER BY d.position
