%%report goal-funding-allocated-amount-per-goal title: Total allocated amount per goal entity: GoalFunding chart: bar x: goal y: total_allocated_amount help: An allocation of an investment, portfolio or cash flow toward a goal. Goal Fundings added up on allocated amount for each goal, ten largest first. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.name::text, '(none)') AS goal, ROUND(SUM(x.allocated_amount)::numeric, 2) AS total_allocated_amount FROM bus_goal_funding x LEFT JOIN bus_goal p ON p.id = x.goal_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST LIMIT 10
