%%report amc-age-bands title: How recently amcs were changed entity: AMC chart: bar x: last_changed y: records help: The asset management company responsible for fund schemes. Records by time since their last change; the oldest band is the stale tail to review or retire. sql: SELECT CASE WHEN updated_at >= now() - interval '30 days' THEN 'last 30 days' WHEN updated_at >= now() - interval '90 days' THEN '30 to 90 days' WHEN updated_at >= now() - interval '180 days' THEN '90 to 180 days' ELSE 'older than 180 days' END AS last_changed, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_amc WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY MIN(updated_at) DESC
