%%report equity-per-security title: Equities per security entity: Equity chart: bar x: security y: records help: Equity-specific information for a security, including trading venue, ticker and economic sector. Which security the most equities belong to; the head of the list is the concentration to know about. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.name::text, '(none)') AS security, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_equity x LEFT JOIN bus_security p ON p.id = x.security_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10
%%report equity-completeness title: How complete equities are entity: Equity chart: bar x: field y: missing help: Equity-specific information for a security, including trading venue, ticker and economic sector. For each optional field, how many equities leave it empty; the long bars are the fields nobody fills in. sql: SELECT 'exchange' AS field, COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE exchange IS NULL) AS missing FROM bus_equity WHERE deleted_at IS NULL UNION ALL SELECT 'ticker', COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE ticker IS NULL) FROM bus_equity WHERE deleted_at IS NULL UNION ALL SELECT 'sector', COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE sector IS NULL) FROM bus_equity WHERE deleted_at IS NULL ORDER BY 2 DESC
%%report bond-coupon-rate-per-month title: Average coupon rate per month entity: Bond chart: line x: month y: average_coupon_rate help: Debt-instrument terms for a security, including issuer, coupon, maturity and credit assessment. The average coupon rate of bonds created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(coupon_rate)::numeric, 2) AS average_coupon_rate FROM bus_bond WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
