%%report capital-gain-largest-by-sale-proceeds title: The ten largest capital gains by sale proceeds entity: CapitalGain chart: bar x: record y: sale_proceeds help: A disposal calculation comparing proceeds with the allocated cost basis for a tax lot. The records with the highest sale proceeds; worth reading for outliers and for the few that carry most of the total. sql: SELECT gain_type::text AS record, sale_proceeds FROM bus_capital_gain WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND sale_proceeds IS NOT NULL ORDER BY sale_proceeds DESC LIMIT 10
%%report capital-gain-cost-basis-per-month title: Average cost basis per month (Capital Gain) entity: CapitalGain chart: line x: month y: average_cost_basis help: A disposal calculation comparing proceeds with the allocated cost basis for a tax lot. The average cost basis of capital gains created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(cost_basis)::numeric, 2) AS average_cost_basis FROM bus_capital_gain WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
