%%report compliance-case-lifecycle title: Compliance Case lifecycle entity: ComplianceCase chart: bar x: state y: records help: The controlled investigation of an AML, KYC, conduct or regulatory concern. Where compliance cases sit in their state machine, in the order the diagram draws it; a state nothing has reached shows as zero. sql: SELECT d.state, COALESCE(c.records, 0) AS records FROM (SELECT 'opened' AS state, 0 AS position UNION ALL SELECT 'investigating', 1 UNION ALL SELECT 'awaiting_information', 2 UNION ALL SELECT 'escalated', 3 UNION ALL SELECT 'reported', 4 UNION ALL SELECT 'cleared', 5 UNION ALL SELECT 'closed', 6) d LEFT JOIN (SELECT status AS state, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_compliance_case WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1) c ON c.state = d.state ORDER BY d.position
